%% Infinity-Context v1.2.0 candidate; measurements: docs/numbers.md
flowchart TB
  subgraph AGENTS["Agent surfaces"]
    CC["Claude Code: native output replacement"]
    CX["Codex: PostToolUse capture only; replacement capability false"]
    AG["Antigravity: capture and supported context hooks"]
    HM["Hermes: user-installed ContextEngine shim"]
  end
  CC & CX & AG & HM --> MMU["icx-adapters: validate input and redact before persistence"]
  MMU --> CODEC["Plane 1 / icx-codec: symbolic skeleton + Braille projection; lossy model view"]
  MMU --> CAS["Plane 2 / icx-core: FastCDC + BLAKE3 CAS + Merkle-DAG; exact post-redaction bytes"]
  CAS --> INDEX["Plane 3 / icx-hdc + icx-store: exact-token postings + HDC/fractal candidates + temporal PPR"]
  INDEX --> RANK["Rank: lexical coverage, combined score, artifact ID; common postings may span corpus"]
  INDEX --> SNAP["ICXHDC04 writes; 03 reads; MMU rebuilds missing postings from CAS event log"]
  MMU --> EPOCH["Plane 4 / epoch controller + HTTP/1 JSON proxy: immutable cold history, budgeted selection"]
  RANK --> WINDOW["Bounded managed window: head + selected sealed frames + recent frames + structured tail"]
  EPOCH --> WINDOW
  MMU --> BUS["Plane 5 / icx-bus: in-process atomics; file-backed positioned I/O and writer lock"]
  BUS --> WINDOW
  WINDOW --> TAIL["Whole useful tail frames; compact CAS handles; unsent bus events stay queued"]
  MMU --> STORE["Daemon: SQLite WAL synchronous=FULL; commit before successful ACK; no write-behind"]
  TAIL --> MCP["Canonical tool icx: validated JSON-RPC envelope and typed operation arguments"]
  MCP --> AGENTS
